<Layout title="About Zulo | Led by Daniel Zuloaga" description="Zulo is an AI strategy and engineering firm led by Daniel Zuloaga. Each engagement gets a team built for its scope, with the founder involved from strategy through delivery." nav="about">
  <main id="main-content" class="transformation-page">
    <section class="page-masthead site-container">
      <p class="section-kicker">ABOUT ZULO</p>
      <h1>Business judgment.<br />A builder’s perspective.</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">An AI strategy and engineering firm led by Daniel Zuloaga. Each engagement gets a team built for its scope, with the founder involved from strategy through delivery.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="case-narrative site-container section-pad about-firm">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">THE FIRM</p><h2>Senior-led.<br />Sized to the work.</h2></div>
      <div class="case-prose"><p class="case-prose-lead">Zulo is built on one arrangement: the person who scopes the work leads it, and stays answerable for it until your team runs it.</p><p>A program is more than one person can deliver, so the team is assembled for each engagement. Engineers, designers, and domain consultants join for the workstreams that need them, and the team changes shape as the program does.</p><p>What stays fixed is the lead. Strategy, architecture, and the hard calls go through Daniel, so the person you meet at the start is the person accountable at the end.</p><a class="text-action light-link" href="/services#engagement">See how we engage <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
        <section id="about" class="about-section dark-surface">
            <div class="site-container about-grid"><div class="about-monogram" aria-hidden="true"><span>dz<span>.</span></span><div>PRODUCT × ENGINEERING × BUSINESS</div></div><div><p class="section-kicker">LED BY DANIEL ZULOAGA</p><h2>A builder who sees<br />the whole business</h2><p class="about-intro">I’m Daniel Zuloaga. Engineer, product lead, MBA. I’ve spent twenty years building software and working with the people who depend on it.</p><p>That work has taught me to look beyond the software itself. A solution has to make sense for the business, fit how the team works, and be worth the time and money it takes to build.</p><p>Most recently, I’ve been shipping AI in regulated finance, helping teams review documents, find information, and spend less time on repetitive tasks. Accuracy matters there, and people need to trust a system before they’ll use it.</p><p>I lead every engagement at Zulo. You have direct access to me, and I bring in the engineers, designers, and domain consultants the scope calls for. Together, we build around your business constraints and help your team put the systems to use.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/daniel-zuloaga/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meet Daniel on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></div>
        </section>
    <ProjectCTA />
  </main>
</Layout>
